# Build context of server/Dockerfile (the repository root). BuildKit reads this file in place
# of a root .dockerignore. Secrets never enter the context: server/deploy/.env holds the
# tunnel token and dashboard.env the app's secrets.
# The image builds the front end itself (the Dockerfile's web stage), so no local build output
# or dependencies are sent: a stale web/dist or server/internal/web/dist can never ship.
.git
.pane
worktrees
tmp
**/node_modules
**/.astro
**/dist
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
docs/evidence
web/design
server/bin
server/data
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.env
!**/*.env.example
